Common error

If you get:

Unable to load asset: assets/flutter-logo.png

check these three things:

The file is actually inside assets/.
The filename is exactly flutter-logo.png.
pubspec.yaml contains:
assets:
  - assets/flutter-logo.png

Then run:

flutter pub get

and restart the application.

